  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(184,49,47);\"><strong>The Basics </strong></span></p><ul><li>Brand category: Specialty food and gourmet vinegar products</li><li>Target audience: Health-conscious home cooks and food lovers seeking natural, antioxidant-rich ingredients</li><li>Primary selling region: United States, with online direct-to-consumer sales and also available on Faire for wholesalers</li><li>Maturity label: Emerging, mission-led brand focused on sustainable local agriculture</li><li>Product highlights: Cherry vinegar made from peak-ripeness cherries, non-GMO, no additives or preservatives, versatile for drinks, marinades, dressings, pickling, gifts, and subscriptions</li></ul><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(184,49,47);\">About Us:</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">At <a href=\"http://www.redtruckorchards.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Red Truck Orchards</a>, our purpose is to strengthen and support local farms by crafting exceptional cherry vinegar that nourishes daily life. Every bottle of our Cherry Vinegar reflects our dedication to sustainable farming, community collaboration, and artisan craftsmanship. From farm to table, we’re proud to deliver a better vinegar that’s good for you and tastes great.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px;color:rgb(184,49,47);\"><strong>How We Are Different:</strong></span></p><p>We buy local cherries at a fair price from nearby cherry farmers (and use cherries from our own orchard, Hallstedt Homestead Cherries) and use everything except the pit. Using our skin-on double fermentation process, we craft a Cherry Vinegar that has a bright, complex flavor and lingering cherry finish, while still keeping the antioxidants in our vinegar. We do not back sweeten our vinegar or add any artificial colors or flavors. Just Cherry Vinegar, grown locally, and made on a farm.</p><p><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(184,49,47);\">How To Sell:</span></strong></span></p><p>We find that consumers that use vinegar as part of their daily wellness routine appreciate that we also include the <a href=\"https://www.redtruckorchards.com/pages/whycherryvinegar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">antioxidants of cherries</a>, while having a smoother and less harsh taste than apple cider vinegar.</p><p>Foodies also love that this is a new product, with a lingering cherry finish that's great for marinades, sauces, salad dressing, pickling, and more!</p><p>Check out the <a href=\"https://www.redtruckorchards.com/pages/recipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">recipes </a>on our website for some ideas!</p></div></div>",
